Ihya":true},{"ayah":44,"text":"وَنَادَىٰٓ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْجَنَّةِ أَصْحَٰبَ ٱلنَّارِ أَن قَدْ وَجَدْنَا مَا وَعَدَنَا رَبُّنَا حَقًّا فَهَلْ وَجَدتُّم مَّا وَعَدَ رَبُّكُمْ حَقًّاۖ قَالُوا۟ نَعَمْۚ فَأَذَّنَ مُؤَذِّنٌۢ بَيْنَهُمْ أَن لَّعْنَةُ ٱللَّهِ عَلَى ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ ","translation":"And the companions of Paradise will call out to the companions of the Fire, \"We have already found what our Lord promised us to be true. Have you found what your Lord promised to be true?\" They will say, \"Yes.\" Then an announcer will announce among them, \"The curse of Allāh shall be upon the wrongdoers","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَنَادَىٰٓ","translit":"ٰٓàَdāَnَw","root":"ندي"},{"id":2,"arabic":"أَصْحَٰبُ","translit":"ُbَٰḥْṣَaʾ","root":"صحب"},{"id":3,"arabic":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","translit":"ِẗَّnَjgْlٱ","root":"جنن"},{"id":4,"arabic":"أَصْحَٰبَ","translit":"َbَٰḥْṣَaʾ","root":"صحب"},{"id":5,"arabic":"ٱلنَّارِ","translit":"ِrāَّnlٱ","root":"نور"},{"id":6,"arabic":"أَن","translit":"nَaʾ","root":""},{"id":7,"arabic":"قَدْ","translit":"ْdَq","root":""},{"id":8,"arabic":"وَجَدْنَا","translit":"āَnْdَjgَw","root":"وجد"},{"id":9,"arabic":"مَا","translit":"āَm","root":""},{"id":10,"arabic":"وَعَدَنَا","translit":"āَnَdَʿعَw","root":"وعد"},{"id":11,"arabic":"رَبُّنَا","translit":"āَnُّbَr","root":"ربب"},{"id":12,"arabic":"حَقًّا","translit":"āًّqَḥ","root":"حقق"},{"id":13,"arabic":"فَهَلْ","translit":"ْlَhَf","root":""},{"id":14,"arabic":"وَجَدتُّم","translit":"mُّtdَjgَw","root":"وجد"},{"id":15,"arabic":"مَّا","translit":"āَّm","root":""},{"id":16,"arabic":"وَعَدَ","translit":"َdَʿعَw","root":"وعد"},{"id":17,"arabic":"رَبُّكُمْ","translit":"ْmُkُّbَr","root":"ربب"},{"id":18,"arabic":"حَقًّا","translit":"āًّqَḥ","root":"حقق"},{"id":19,"arabic":"قَالُوا۟","translit":"۟āwُlāَq","root":"قول"},{"id":20,"arabic":"نَعَمْ","translit":"ْmَʿعَn","root":""},{"id":21,"arabic":"فَأَذَّنَ","translit":"َnَّhdَaʾَf","root":"اذن"},{"id":22,"arabic":"مُؤَذِّنٌۢ","translit":"ٌۢnِّhdَwʾُm","root":"اذن"},{"id":23,"arabic":"بَيْنَهُمْ","translit":"ْmُhَnْyَb","root":"بين"},{"id":24,"arabic":"أَن","translit":"nَaʾ","root":""},{"id":25,"arabic":"لَّعْنَةُ","translit":"ُẗَnْʿعَّl","root":"لعن"},{"id":26,"arabic":"ٱللَّهِ","translit":"ِhَّllٱ","root":"اله"},{"id":27,"arabic":"عَلَى","translit":"àَlَʿع","root":""},{"id":28,"arabic":"ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ","translit":"َnyِmِlَّٰẓlٱ","root":"ظلم"}],"hasIhya":true},{"ayah":45,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ يَصُدُّونَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ وَيَبْغُونَهَا عِوَجًا وَهُم بِٱلْءَاخِرَةِ كَٰفِرُونَ ","translation":"Who averted [people] from the way of Allāh and sought to make it [seem] deviant while they were, concerning the Hereafter, disbelievers.\"","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"ٱلَّذِينَ","translit":"َnyِhdَّlٱ","root":""},{"id":2,"arabic":"يَصُدُّونَ","translit":"َnwُّdُṣَy","root":"صدد"},{"id":3,"arabic":"عَن","translit":"nَʿع","root":""},{"id":4,"arabic":"سَبِيلِ","translit":"ِlyِbَs","root":"سبل"},{"id":5,"arabic":"ٱللَّهِ","translit":"ِhَّllٱ","root":"اله"},{"id":6,"arabic":"وَيَبْغُونَهَا","translit":"āَhَnwُغْbَyَw","root":"بغي"},{"id":7,"arabic":"عِوَجًا","translit":"āًjgَwِʿع","root":"عوج"},{"id":8,"arabic":"وَهُم","translit":"mُhَw","root":""},{"id":9,"arabic":"بِٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","translit":"ِẗَrِhkāَءْlٱِb","root":"اخر"},{"id":10,"arabic":"كَٰفِرُونَ","translit":"َnwُrِfَٰk","root":"كفر"}],"hasIhya":false},{"ayah":46,"text":"وَبَيْنَهُمَا حِجَابٌۚ وَعَلَى ٱلْأَعْرَافِ رِجَالٌ يَعْرِفُونَ كُلًّۢا بِسِيمَىٰهُمْۚ وَنَادَوْا۟ أَصْحَٰبَ ٱلْجَنَّةِ أَن سَلَٰمٌ عَلَيْكُمْۚ لَمْ يَدْخُلُوهَا وَهُمْ يَطْمَعُونَ ","translation":"And between them will be a partition [i.e., wall], and on [its] elevations are men[1] who recognize all[2] by their mark. And they call out to the companions of Paradise, \"Peace be upon you.\" They have not [yet] entered it, but they long intensely.","words":[{"id":1,"arabic":"وَبَيْنَهُمَا","translit":"āَmُhَnْyَbَw","root":"بين"},{"id":2,"arabic":"حِجَابٌ","translit":"ٌbāَjgِḥ","root":"حجب"},{"id":3,"arabic":"وَعَلَى","translit":"àَlَʿ